ving into “correction” territory which means that it is falling between 10% to 20%\n\t\t- If it falls below 20% then it is considered a bear market\n\t\t- Some investors think that tech sector is overvalued. Raising interest rates can also be part of the reason\n\t\t- **Corrections are normal part of stock market, usually they are followed by growth**\n\t- Global chip shortage is hurting the car industry \n\t\t- Semiconductor shortage is causing can manufacturers to slow down on the production of vehicles\n\t\t- WFH is creating a high demand for electronics"},"slip-box/reference-notes/Revolutionary battery checklist.md":{"key":"slip-box/reference-notes/Revolutionary battery checklist.md","path":"slip-box/reference-notes/Revolutionary battery checklist.md","embedding":{"vec":[-0.11709462106227875,0.040825795382261276,-0.015907971188426018,-0.02361101657152176,0.034558750689029694,0.03069118782877922,0.041194114834070206,0.060968756675720215,-0.02708377316594124,-0.01435481570661068,0.04812224209308624,-0.01507758628576994,0.03062053769826889,0.050939034670591354,0.030824610963463783,0.03731187433004379,0.073870450258255,-0.09223204851150513,0.018000636249780655,0.012386036105453968,0.11549796909093857,-0.027899697422981262,0.05087296664714813,0.0024857809767127037,0.0279410220682621,0.01599837839603424,-0.022166453301906586,0.005205370485782623,-0.06414172053337097,-0.2034849226474762,-0.033480241894721985,0.006433514412492514,0.008948519825935364,-0.0022190269082784653,-0.04262762889266014,-0.011347541585564613,-0.009343934245407581,-0.018920322880148888,-0.04878438264131546,0.03545771911740303,-0.0019162908429279923,0.02367446944117546,-0.085907481610775,-0.010914092883467674,-0.022524531930685043,-0.023349806666374207,-0.002642091829329729,0.0053649102337658405,0.03756264969706535,-0.03479510918259621,0.030805189162492752,0.011704889126121998,0.0634976401925087,-0.04670342430472374,-0.0033015315420925617,0.028623254969716072,-0.0014363325899466872,0.04938741400837