st FROM \"\" WHERE file.mday = date(\"2024-04-09\") SORT file.mtime asc\n\n```\n\ncreated: 2023-01-16 11:50","length":736,"class_name":"SmartBlock","heading":"\\Tuesday, April 09, 2024","lines":[9,52]},"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md":{"key":"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md","path":"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md","embedding":{},"text":"slip-box > reference-notes > Misbelief: :\n---\nauthor:\n  - Dan Ariely\ntags:\n  - \"#sociology\"\n---","length":53,"class_name":"SmartBlock","heading":null,"lines":[0,5]},"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md#📖 Short Summary (1 takeaway)":{"key":"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md#📖 Short Summary (1 takeaway)","path":"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md#📖 Short Summary (1 takeaway)","embedding":{},"text":"slip-box > reference-notes > Misbelief: 📖 Short Summary (1 takeaway):\n- A mix of personal and professional explanation of how someone can be sucked into believing in conspiracy theory and be so rooted in it such that they can alienate their closest allies.","length":187,"class_name":"SmartBlock","heading":"📖 Short Summary (1 takeaway)","lines":[6,8]},"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md#🙊 Great quotes":{"key":"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md#🙊 Great quotes","path":"slip-box/reference-notes/Misbelief.md#🙊 Great quotes","embedding":{},"text":"slip-box > reference-notes > Misbelief: 🙊 Great quotes:\n> There is a phrase in Hebrew that loosely translates to “How can you prove that your sister is not a prostitute when you don’t even have a sister?”\n\n> Hate is not a conversation.\n\n> There were many statements in their social media feeds about “doing their own research” and calling on others to do the same. But it was clear that no one was really doing any\n\n> The oft-quoted (and variously attributed) phrase “There is no expedient to which a man will not resort to avoid the real labor of thinking” came to mind as one that is exceptionally true in social media.\n\n> As a social scientist who is supposed to understand human nature, I am a bit embarrassed to admit that the benefits of my half beard took me by surprise.\n\n> I looked at more and more research on scarcity mindset—the notion that poverty impedes cognitive capacity by taking up part of the brain’s limited bandwidth—and\n\n> What fascinates me—and where I see leverage for posit","length":943,"class_name":"SmartBlock","heading":"🙊 Great quotes","lines":[12,37]},"daily-notes/2024/2024-07-01.md":{"key":"daily-notes/2024/2024-07-01.md","path":"daily-notes/2024/2024-07-01.md","embedding":{},"text":"daily-notes > 2024 > 2024-07-01: :\n⨑ MOOD::\n\n↻ HABIT [[◶ Trackers]]\n[Sketching::]\n[Exercise::]\n[Read::]\n[Personal Work::]\n[Nutrients and Water::]","length":111,"class_name":"SmartBlock","heading":null,"lines":[0,8]},"daily-notes/2024/2024-07-01.md#\\Monday, July 01, 2024":{"key":"daily-notes/2024/2024-07-01.md#\\Monday, July 01, 2024","path":"daily-notes/2024/2024-07-01.md#\\Monday, July 01, 2024","embedding":{},"text":"daily-notes > 2024 > 2024-07-01: \\Monday, July 01, 2024:\n\n### 📅 Daily Questions\n\n##### 🌜 Last night, after work, I\n\n-\n\n##### 🙌 One thing I'm excited about right now is\n\n-\n\n##### 🚀 One+ thing I plan to accomplish today is\n\n- [ ]\n\n##### 👎 One thing I'm struggling with today is\n\n-\n\n## 📝 Ephemeral Notes\n\n-\n\n### Notes created today\n\n```dataview\n\nList FROM \"\" WHERE file.cday = date(\"2024-07-01\") SORT file.ctime asc\n\n```\n\n### Notes last touched today\n\n```dataview\n\nList FROM \"\" WHERE file.mday = date(\"2024-07-01\") SORT file.mtime asc\n\n```\n\ncreated: 2023-01-16 11:50","length":513,"class_name":"SmartBlock","heading":"\\Monday, July 01, 2024","lines":[9,50]},"daily-notes/2024/2024-04-29.md":{"key":"daily-notes/2024/2024-04-29.md","path":"daily-notes/2024/2024-04-29.md","embedding":{},"text":"daily-notes > 2024 > 2024-04-29: :\n⨑ MOOD::\n\n↻ HABIT [[◶ Trackers]]\n[Sketching::]\n[Exercise::]\n[Read::]\n[Personal Work::]\n[Nutrients and Water::]","length